\newlabel{fig:method}{{2}{13}{\textbf {\sysname {} evolution loop.} On a sampled sub-training set, \sysname {} diagnoses both correct and incorrect attempts, explores candidate skill$+$tool capabilities, and promotes the best by validation into a persistent library. \relax }{figure.caption.2}{}}
