\newlabel{fig:distribution_shift}{{3}{13}{\textbf {Online adaptation to distribution shift.} Replay accuracy across five backbones and three stream constructions. \emph {Online adapt} stays close to the \emph {Oracle} upper bound and far above \emph {Static} everywhere; the gap is largest under the stress protocol, where \emph {Direct} nearly collapses. Error bars are seed std (50--200 seeds per cell). \relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
